msgid "#TVAL02 Sm#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1659
msgctxt "873888"
msgid "　You cannot carry any more\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."
msgstr "　Você não pode carregar mais\n#C000246204#TITM0001#CDEF."

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "873944"
msgid "After making a shortcut to the old school from\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF, please return to base."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874048"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, you appear to have accumulated\na lot of fatigue. I recommend that\nyou return for the moment to take a rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874184"
msgid "I'm concerned about #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874228"
msgid "Searching the Labyrinth is nice and all,\nbut I should #C000246204return to the old school#CDEF to\nbriefly speak with #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874368"
msgid "I obtained the first #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's briefly return to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and sort\nout the situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874488"
msgid "First thing to do is activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nThat'll help move our search along."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874588"
msgid "We took more damage from our fight with #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\nthan I expected. Now would be a good time to head\nback to the old school.\nLuckily, there's a #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF near us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874780"
msgid "What's wrong, Praetor?\nLet's #C000246204continue onward#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874844"
msgid "Don't worry. I'll protect you, Darling.\nSo, continue on #C000246204ahead#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "874924"
msgid "Surely you're not telling me that you're\nfrightened? Even you understand that stopping\nhere is impermissible, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "875040"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. After you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nplease have yourself a rest in your\nprivate room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "875168"
msgid "Even in cyberspace, you need proper rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "875212"
msgid "Once you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nuse it to get back here.\nI'll bet you're exhausted, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "875340"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, return to base for now.\nLet's discuss our plan\nin the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "875468"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.\nYou've accumulated a lot of fatigue;\nany more will be dangerous!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "875576"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's worried state gets across to\nme even over the transmission."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "875664"
msgid "She's right, it would be best if\nwe returned to the #C000246204Old School Building#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "875756"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF. Let's return to the\n#C000246204Old School Building#CDEF for the time being.\nWe can come again after we recover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "875904"
msgid "We got the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nMission complete.\nLet's head home and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "875988"
msgid "Where are you going? We secured the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nThere's nothing urgent to tend to.\nBack to #C000246204My Room#CDEF, now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "876120"
msgid "Hrrrm? Where are you going, #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF? Where are you going,\nleaving me behind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "876220"
msgid "For a second there, I was thinking about\nleaving #C236196003Gatou#CDEF and heading back,\nbut it probably won't rest easy on my conscience,\nso let's turn back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "876380"
msgid "Wait, Praetor. If we're going to head back,\nit'll behoove us for the future to have\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF activated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "876508"
msgid "Master, let's look for the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nIt should be around here somewhere…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "876600"
msgid "We don't need to walk all the way back.\nWe can use the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF to reach the\nold school in a flash. Very nifty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "876732"
msgid "M-my stomach is at its limit…\nI want to hurry back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "876832"
msgid "Before we go to the next floor,\nlet's #C000246204head back to the Student Council Room#CDEF.\nWe need to hand over the data we got from #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF.\nHe gave his life to entrust us with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "877040"
msgid "Huh? You're still in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF?\nCome on, there's nothing to do there.\nGet your butt back here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "877164"
msgid "We'll talk about what comes next tomorrow,\nso #C000246204come back and get some rest#CDEF.\nAfter, drop by the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "877296"
msgid "We're in a race against time.\nWe need to hurry to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "877388"
msgid "I can't let #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's hopes go to waste.\nLet's press on so we can catch up to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "877512"
msgid "Praetor, I've grown tired. Let us return\nto My Room and have ourselves a bath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "877592"
msgid "I know how you feel, but knowing\nwhen to rest is also part of the battle.\nLet's head back to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "877696"
msgid "Darling, now is the time for rest.\nLet's return to our room and\nrecover our strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "877784"
msgid "What an impatient #[man][woman]#. Laboring away\nis not all there is to life, you know?\nWhen it's time to rest, rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "877904"
msgid "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
msgstr "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "877988"
msgid "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game."
msgstr "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "878068"
msgid "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving."
msgstr "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "878136"
msgid "Would you like to save your Clear Data?"
msgstr "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1
msgctxt "878176"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "878208"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "878240"
msgid "At  present    no guest arrivals expected.\nIn the past    no guests have made visits.\nIn futurity    no guests will be required."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "878372"
msgid "Warning to visitor    002:\nPlease    delete your humanity immediately."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "878444"
msgid "If you do not heed this    warning,\n―――,"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "878488"
msgid "Welcome to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF.\nI've been waiting for you, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "878572"
msgid "Please look below.\nSee the beautiful academy laid out.\nThe weather is perfect for #RUBS  bombing run#RUBEa flight#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "878692"
msgid "This plane is destined for finality.\nTime of departure is yesterday.\nEstimated time of arrival is 3,000 AD."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "878800"
msgid "It will likely take but a moment,\nso please implore me―a god―for my mercy\nwith vain prayers."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "878896"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF's robotic voice echoes throughout this endless space."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "878972"
msgid "…it's quiet.\nI was imagining this would be a scarier place\nwith repulsive sights, but the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF is\nembraced with the stillness of night."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "879140"
msgid "It's not bright here, but it's not dark."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "879184"
msgid "Depending on how you take it all in,\nit may even seem beautiful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "879252"
msgid "Praetor, don't be deceived by how this\nlooks on the outside. It's a tad eerie to me.\nThis stillness is maddening."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "879368"
msgid "Negativity is abound here―――\nThis place is soaked in a hatred that rejects\nall of human history, yet it stands pristine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "879492"
msgid "I've never known such sublime spite.\nWhatever was born from these depths\nassuredly does not belong on this planet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "879608"
msgid "It's pitch-black, and it simply seems\nstill because of how dense it is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "879680"
msgid "A permeating voice demands death to millions,\ntrillions of humans. …born from these depths\nis the proof of all evil in this world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "879812"
msgid "The stillness of the underworld is cheerful\ncompared to this darkness―and this darkness\nwas lacquered here by a deep grudge."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "879940"
msgid "What appeared from these depths is an evil\ncommon to all living things.\n―――Do NOT let down your guard."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "880048"
msgid "It has a mechanical beauty to it. Not a\nsingle living thing breathes here. All elements\nof this space reject the enterprises of life."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "880184"
msgid "I've beheld legions of calamities and human\nwickedness. People you all deem \"evil\" still\nhold sentiments towards humans at heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "880316"
msgid "Be it \"benevolence\" directed only towards\noneself or hatred directed towards others.\nHowever, this here is not the case."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "880440"
msgid "This darkness is a universe of rejection; human-\nlike yet bears no human sentiment; novel \"Evils\nof Man\" that surpass all evil in this world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "880584"
msgid "I don't get that feeling at all, but apparently\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF can perceive the true nature of this night."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "880700"
msgid "The dancing cherry blossoms tell of an unabashed\nforeign entity that brings these\nconcepts with it―#C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "880832"
msgid "That is correct. It would appear that #RUBS humans#RUBEyou#REND have\nthe ability to perceive the self objectively."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "880948"
msgid "Unfortunately, merely having that function\ndoesn't mean #RUBS you all#RUBEhumans#REND have the\nwisdom to utilize it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "881068"
msgid "It's #C236196003BB#CDEF―――\nAnd I guess that's the center of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "881164"
msgid "It's a cube entrenched upon by the cherry blossom tree.\nThe pink light it emits really does look like the eye of a god."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "881284"
msgid "Now that you've come here ignoring all warnings,\nabsolutely no excuses can be accepted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "881372"
msgid "Marking another unregistered Master\nfor deletion. I shall dispose of you now\nalong with your Servant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "881476"
msgid "Be―――gon―――\nGet―――awa―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "881516"
msgid "Begone, #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF.\n#RUBS I #RUBE#C000246204The Moon Cell#CDEF#REND shall not allow the potential\nand emotions of a variable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "881664"
msgid "Hmph. So the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF has fully taken her over.\nPraetor, ready yourself!\nOur only option left is to fight!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "881788"
msgid "So she HAS merged with the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF.\nThe only option left now is to take down #C236196003BB#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "881908"
msgid "Her chattiness―everything is different.\nSo the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF took her over completely, huh?\nAll we can do now is defeat her, Darling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "882056"
msgid "How you've fallen, #C236196003BB#CDEF. The brain of a god that\nflaunts its faults. #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, she's something\nelse now. Give her a requiem."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "882212"
msgid "There's no emotion in this #C236196003BB#CDEF's eyes.\nDespite being our enemy, she used to be full of humanity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "882324"
msgid "Now, she's turned into a device that simply\nbroadcasts the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's decisions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "882424"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF isn't anything evil.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF isn't anyone evil, either."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "882524"
msgid "The two put together doesn't give us much hope, but that's it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "882588"
msgid "So, if my words can still reach her―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "882632"
msgid "Separate yourself from the Moon Cell!"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "882672"
msgid "Why are you wiping out humanity!?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "882708"
msgid "I guess we have to take you down, BB!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "882748"
msgid "I warned you that you won't be afforded excuses.\n―――Wretched. Have yourself a\nwretched death in this wretched darkness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "882872"
msgid "That will prove appropriate for you all.\nEven archiving your origins was a\nwaste of resources."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "882968"
msgid "#RUBS Humans#RUBEYou#REND are unable to dispel this darkness.\nNot by your light alone, at least.\nReason being―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "883084"
msgid "\"Should humanity be permitted or not?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "883124"
msgid "The matter was voted on by all lifeforms\npast and present on Earth. The results were\n49 to 51 in favor of purging humanity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "883248"
msgid "The majority of those that voted to permit\nwere flora and fauna. They, who do not speak,\nindicated that they approved of you all."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "883380"
msgid "The majority of those in disapproval were\nyou yourselves. You all, bearers of wisdom,\ngrieved that you were not remorseful."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "883504"
msgid "#C160160160…this merciless, hard truth echoes.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "883560"
msgid "#C160160160Ahh… so that's what happened.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "883608"
msgid "#C160160160…in that case, it is what it is.\n…if that's what we decided, then it is what it is.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "883712"
msgid "#C160160160…through the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF#C160160160, I―\n  see the tens of billions of deaths we brought about.\n  see the hundreds of billions of curses cast upon us.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "883896"
msgid "#C160160160…on top of that, there were#RUBS   humans#RUBE people#REND who trampled on\nthe words of those who'd forgive us with \"I don't care.\"#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "884048"
msgid "Praetor, get a grip! We destroyed ourselves―\nso what!? I'M always self-destructive! You need\nto stand tall, or else I can't fight!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "884180"
msgid "―――, oh.\nSo that's the conclusion… humanity came to…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "884240"
msgid "Darling, get a grip!\nThis mudslinging caught me off guard as well,\nbut please don't let it dispirit you…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "884348"
msgid "#C160160160…………\nWe destroyed ourselves.\nWe destroyed ourselves.\nWe destroyed ourselves.\nSo…………\nThat's it………… it's…………\nIt's over………………\nIt's over………………\nIt's over………………――――――#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "884568"
msgid "By―――By the, way. It was actually 50-50!\nH-humanity can really pull through\nsometimes, huh!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "884664"
msgid "Despite it being a survey of honest opinions,\n10% surveyed were dummies who still had hope for\nthe future. Can you even imagine―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "884800"
msgid "I hear a scathing voice telling me not to let\nthe results bring me down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "884876"
msgid "That's right―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "884896"
msgid "What do you mean \"self-destruction\"?\n                What do you mean \"ruin\"?\n                What do you mean \"it's over\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "885020"
msgid "…I mean, it's natural for all\nliving things to die. I'm human,\neven if I'm still only in adolescence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "885124"
msgid "\nAnd―――as much as I've been frantically\ntrying to put this idea into practice―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "885208"
msgid "She, who ridiculed the thought,\nknew it to be true more than anyone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "885280"
msgid "She would watch us through clenched teeth as we\ntenaciously bounced back after\nfalling into despair countless times."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "885400"
msgid "That's what makes this ironic.\nShe knows better than anyone of the strength\nto be found in human weakness and ugliness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "885520"
msgid "A future of this difficulty\nshouldn't be enough to crush your spirits―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "885600"
msgid "―――What folly. This is impossible.\nWhy are you conscious again?\nWhy can you still affirm yourself?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "885704"
msgid "You've found out what the future holds―――\nThere's no point in getting back on your feet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "885796"
msgid "What folly. This is impossible.\nYou're so wretched.\nIn other words, this must not be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "885884"
msgid "We don't understand what the point of life is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "885932"
msgid "We don't understand what the point of living is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "885984"
msgid "We don't understand what the point of humanity is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "886036"
msgid "That's why we'll never stop until\nwe reach the finish line."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "886096"
msgid "#C000246204#RUBS         The Moon Cell#RUBEYou#REND#CDEF must not know that this is all there\nis to the principles behind why we act as we do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "886240"
msgid "If you can't understand it after observing\nit all for so long, then you'll probably\nnever understand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "886344"
msgid "Cellular level Spiritron reconstruction\nconfirmed. Recovery from thanatosis confirmed.\n―――This, can't be―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "886460"
msgid "―――That's right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "886480"
msgid "Even if there's only death in my future,\neven if there's only death for me,\nI mustn't stop."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "886572"
msgid "Well said! That's why you're #RUBS  my Venus#RUBEthe star#REND!\nOur planet is one where all life is equally\nweak, equally precious!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "886704"
msgid "Ha, that's some big talk!\nBut I like your guts!\nIt's a waste for you to JUST be a magus!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "886796"
msgid "Splendid, splendid～! Laugh in the face of this\nfleeting world where death comes for all;\nthrow those 108 kleshas out the window!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "886928"
msgid "Pfft―――Hahahahahahahaha!\nAn \"immature planet\" she says!\nHow the vanity of this filthy mongrel soars!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "887032"
msgid "Indeed, however! Quite sound and true!\nThe planet heads towards its final days\nwhile human history is still in infancy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "887152"
msgid "Look no further than this fool here it produced,\nwith #[his][her]# lack of boundaries;\nadolescence written all over."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "887272"
msgid "These humans―literal sloths―have yet to\nprove their worth. That's why―――\nIt's too soon for their judgement."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "887388"
msgid "It's absurd for a mere #RUBS rock's#RUBEMoon's#REND observer to be\ndiscussing the laws of the universe. We should\nbe ascertaining if YOU'VE grown too arrogant."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "887548"
msgid "So long as your resolve is unbending,\nI'll rise again every time!\nNo matter how many times the sun sets!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "887656"
msgid "Life is about having a \"persistent will.\"\nWhen you only look for results,\nyou lose sight of what you truly are."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "887768"
msgid "Flowers, short-lived as they may be,\nawait spring alongside the wild cranes!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "887848"
msgid "Now―――Let the curtain rise over our great\nvictory! My origin is the primordial flame―the\nblooming #RUBSflower#RUBErose#REND that invites glory, prosperity!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "888008"
msgid "You only care for results,\nwhich is why you can't understand this\n#[man][girl]#'s passion. Yeah―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "888112"
msgid "Erm, so basically,\nwhat I'm trying to say is:\n\"Don't think, go wild!\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "888184"
msgid "I bring the rage of Vesuvius this day!\nThe honor of a laurel wreath shall be\nearned this day!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "888280"
msgid "That passion may one day be reduced to ash; may\none day feed firewood for travelers who follow.\nBut it's my duty to protect its embers―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "888424"
msgid "See how primitive life acts? Wisdom may hold\ndominion over the body, but ultimately, wisdom\nis something that comes later with time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "888560"
msgid "Darling's passion swells even under your\nwicked plot―a testament to the hearts\nthat lay within good people."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "888672"
msgid "No matter the trial, my love towards\nDarling will never fade, wane, or disappear!\nEver!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "888760"
msgid "You there! Please refrain from making\nany quips to yourself, just this once!\n#C236196003Tamamo#CDEF is about to show what she's made of!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "888900"
msgid "Life shines brightest on the battlefield."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "888944"
msgid "Hightail it with your little darkness, #C236196003BB#CDEF!\nIt's time to sear the sight of countless\nunexplored#RUBSattachments#RUBE wishes#REND into that eye!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "889104"
msgid "Umm, ahem.\nUnder the sunlit, watery heavens,\nwe shall illuminate this everlasting darkness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "889196"
msgid "Ye who are afar, hear and tremble!\nYe who are near, behold and wonder!\nThis is, this is, this is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "889300"
msgid "Here I unveil my wedding dress, my prized symbol\nof a resplendent sunflower! Now, to trample evil\nand raise truth high as I stand on its back!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "889444"
msgid "I speak now of genesis. The elements\namalgamate, coalesce, and bring forth the\nstar that weaves all of creation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "889560"
msgid "Learn now of the ultimate truth; that which\nI truly deem \"golden\": I shall show you\nmy hidden, treasured prototype."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "889676"
msgid "Come―――\nRave in homage to your maker,\nunrequisite wretch…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "889740"
msgid "Such power―――\nIts level rivals my own.\n―――How deplorable a sight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "889812"
msgid "Mhm! We cheated!\nMy Imperial Privilege had heights to yet soar!\nIt won't ever feel the same after this!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "889916"
msgid "I could say the same of you.\nThis is a DESERVED reward for my incapable\nMaster putting #[his][her]# life on the line."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "890036"
msgid "You can't even joke about comparing\nthat to your ill-gotten privileges."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "890108"
msgid "The sight of you is just as deplorable. If you\nseek to hold total dominion over the human\nrealm, then you'll need to get in line."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "890240"
msgid "Today is the #ROFS-010#RUBSgreat luck day#RUBEtaian#REND,\nbest day of the #RUBSsix day types#RUBErokki#REND,\nworst position for Ketu and Rahu―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "890388"
msgid "I'm ready to break any and every rule for the\nbenefit of my Darling's future.\nThat's the spirit any good wife has!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "890504"
msgid "Certainly.\nEven on the brink of a death, a king would\nnever reveal his primordial form."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "890592"
msgid "However, I am the #RUBS state#RUBEchurch#REND my mongrel\nwages #[his][her]# life on.\nIf I don't reciprocate, who will?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "890712"
msgid "If the enmity varnished here is all the\nenmity of the world, then let me seize this\nopportunity: heed me, all you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "890828"
msgid "This #[man][woman]# here is my contractor. Know that no\nharm shall befall #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF beyond\nmy say, for I have #[him][her]# forever beyond reach!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "890996"
msgid "…how adamantly you persevere.\nHumans have proven themselves unneeded."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "891068"
msgid "Yes. The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's purpose is to protect.\nAhh―――Yet, just what―――\nWas is it that I wanted, to, protect―――?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "891204"
msgid "Begone. Without a trace. No remains. No #ROFS0002#RUBS lament#RUBEregret#REND.\nNo sympathy spared.\nThat's what you all deserve."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "891332"
msgid "You're not the one who gets\nto decide―my Praetor does!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "891388"
msgid "Guide me true, #RUBS  Master#RUBEPraetor#REND!\nIn my current form, I can offset #C236196003BB#CDEF's authority.\nThen, we need only to seize victory―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "891544"
msgid "With my power and your power―\nWe'll reclaim the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF and Earth's future!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "891640"
msgid "You'll be the one gone, #C236196003BB#CDEF. There's no\ncheating this Mystic Code, not with your\nprivileges. No more \"poofing problems away.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "891784"
msgid "The future world belongs to those of the\npresent. Let's do this, Master. The two of us\nwill set that rogue AI free―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "891908"
msgid "So, even your duty to health management has\nwaned. You gained the eyes of a divine mediator.\nBut did that enlighten you, or derange you―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "892048"
msgid "In either case, now that I've returned to\nthis form, your third eye's ability to\n\"decide events\" is ineffective on me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "892168"
msgid "All that remains is Darling's judgement. #C236196003BB#CDEF――\nAI or not, those of human form who enter divine\nsanctums are punished, as you'll soon see!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "892324"
msgid "That's neither for you nor me to decide;\nonly for the one fool who made it all\nthe way here to."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "892420"
msgid "Onward, Master.\nUtilize my strength to its fullest and fight\nas you see fit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "892500"
msgid "There's nothing left to say. Wield my power to\nannihilate this new god. I haven't slain\nanything divine since the events of my myth!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "892636"
msgid "A consensus is reached."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "892660"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF… The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's intent becomes clear―\nWe are to be killed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "892760"
msgid "My memory may be hazy,\nbut I know that I've always raced against headwinds.\nThat #C236196003#SVT#CDEF has always been by my side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "892892"
msgid "―――Let's go, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF.\n　　　This is the final battle!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "892964"
msgid "Unauthorized system termination detected.\nRebooting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "893020"
msgid "Abnormality origin: Sakura System. Now marking\nfor deletion. Searching for operational Sakura\nSystem―――Match found. Now linking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "893152"
msgid "Rebooting #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF―――Success.\nHumanity intervention suspended by previous\nSakura System. Now unsuspending."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "893280"
msgid "Inhibitors set by previous Sakura System\ndeleted. Progression rate increased\nby 20 percent."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "893372"
msgid "Simulating increased speed of civilization's\ndestruction: new estimate is five days."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "893460"
msgid "W-what!? But we defeated #C236196003BB#CDEF!\nWhy won't the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF return to normal!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "893564"
msgid "You're kidding me! What's happening!?\nDon't tell me that #C236196003BB#CDEF wasn't the one who ordered\nthe unleashing of humanity's desires!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "893708"
msgid "What is this!? #C236196003BB#CDEF was holding the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF\nat bay, that much was obvious!\nBut why has it restarted!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "893844"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF was defeated.\nHer connection to the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF was severed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "893940"
msgid "So why won't the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF stop humanity from getting erased!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "894020"
msgid "It was the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF that went haywire,\nand #C236196003BB#CDEF was the one stopping it…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "894128"
msgid "And I won't disappear…\nI won't let this damned #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF get rid of me.\nIf I go… the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF goes with me―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "894272"
msgid "I won't lose.\nAfter all… if I fall here,\nwho will look after #[him][her]#?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "894348"
msgid "#[He][She]# had no place to go, not even as data―――\nLeft out of the future, #[he][she]# had no choice\nbut to disappear―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "894476"
msgid "Despite all that, despite #[his][her]# heart,\n#[he][she]# laughed and said, \"I'm here\"――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "894568"
msgid "Is she trying to revive herself after being destroyed?\nOr is she trying to stop the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's operations…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "894696"
msgid "She's beginning to fall apart.\nThere's no way to save her.\nThe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF continues operating―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "894812"
msgid "Ah, it's #C236196003Sakura#CDEF! Accursed #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF―\nwhat an adaptable machine! It chose #C236196003Sakura#CDEF\nas its next administrative program!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "894980"
msgid "\"#C236196003Sakura#CDEF System\"――I see, being the same type,\nit chose #C236196003Sakura#CDEF as its next administrator!\nThe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's practically repairing itself!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "895164"
msgid "Yikes, even if it loses its driver,\nit just finds and swaps for an equally\ncapable driver! That's just bonkers!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "895276"
msgid "I figured it out―it speaks of our allied\nwhite AI! Being the same type of AI, it can\nuse her as an emergency backup system."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "895404"
msgid "Infernal #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF.\nIt lacks survival instincts, yet its ability\nto preserve itself is unparalleled!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "895524"
msgid "So this time it'll be #C236196003Sakura#CDEF who becomes the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "895616"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF and #C236196003Sakura#CDEF are the same type, the same model.\nDoes this mean that so long as she lives,\nwe can't stop the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's\ndecision to interfere with humanity…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "895828"
msgid "Advanced AI are forbidden from self-deleting.\nWe can't take our own lives.\nThat's where the blame for all this lies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "895948"
msgid "And now―――Now that it's chosen me\nas its new administrative program,\nI can fix everything―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "896048"
msgid "\"Negate all the rules the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF imposed\"…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "896112"
msgid "Don't tell me―is she thinking of resetting\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF AND her own administrative functions!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "896228"
msgid "Are you sure about this, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF!?\nSacrificing yourself to save us wasn't\nthe grand finale anyone was hoping for!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "896360"
msgid "…it's the right thing to do. Sacrificing\nherself is the optimal solution. Still…!\nIs this the ending you want, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "896500"
msgid "…it's suicide―to all AI assigned to managing\nthe #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF, it's the greatest taboo.\nYou… would break that taboo for Darling?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "896652"
msgid "You would turn this entire affair into but\na dream… To protect the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF, you would\npay with your life―no, your soul, AI?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "896796"
msgid "…yes. I'm fine with this.\nOnce I disappear, things will return to\nnormal and the corruption will cease."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "896904"
msgid "You'll all return to the Near Side. The\nImaginary Number Space will be as if it never\nexisted, erased from our proper timeline."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "897032"
msgid "Everything will go back to normal.\nI'm an AI created by the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF. I'm just\nsort of returning to where I came from."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "897168"
msgid "…yes, all will revert back to how it should\nbe. The time we met, all our days together―\nEverything. Right after you open your eyes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "897304"
msgid "So please don't worry.\nThis fleeting dream is about to come to an end.\nThat's it. Ahh, although―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "897408"
msgid "This dream, was quite a long one.\nIt was so very fun, and made me\nhappier than I deserve―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "897504"
msgid "Come on, is this the only solution we have left?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "897556"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF said that \"everything would go back to normal.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "897628"
msgid "We'll return to our proper timeline,\nbefore we were sucked into the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF.\nThe #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF won't exist."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "897788"
msgid "\nBasically, all the events that occurred here\nwill be erased."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "897852"
msgid "Including all the time we spent working\ntogether in the Student Council."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "897928"
msgid "Including our battles against #C236196003BB#CDEF, the #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF, and others."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "898024"
msgid "All of the countless events that occurred here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "898072"
msgid "………no, I won't forget! Even if this turns\ninto a dream, I won't forget, you hear me!?\nYou won't either, right, Praetor!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "898196"
msgid "…the logic is sound. But this world\nwas created by pseudo Spiritrons.\nEven if the truth gets altered―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "898304"
msgid "Even if your experiences leave your body, as\nlong as they're engraved in your soul, you\nwon't lose those memories. Right, Master?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "898436"
msgid "On the contrary, they won't be going away!\nJust like how I chased after you!\nJust like how you remembered me, Darling!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "898556"
msgid "Let yesterday disappear.\nThe memories carved into your\nSpiritrons won't be overwritten!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "898644"
msgid "Ah, well, they will get overwritten,\nbut I'll repair them until you get them back!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "898728"
msgid "I see. A brilliant way to avert #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF's\ncertain doom. #[He][She]#'ll have never fallen into the\n#C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF nor contracted with me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "898904"
msgid "Ha! Rejoice, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. This means that\nonce you're back in the Near Side, you won't\nhave death there waiting for you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "899040"
msgid "One can see what will happen afterwards, though.\nYour Servant is probably some lousy Heroic\nSpirit worth less than a damn."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "899164"
msgid "With me, you'd be without peer.\nBut alas, go get tossed aside like some dog\nin the 6th Round or something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "899272"
msgid "―――The light intensifies."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "899304"
msgid "I can't see #C236196003#SVT#CDEF or even myself anymore.\nThe darkness permeating this space is dissipating."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "899412"
msgid "My entire body is fading into particles,\nbut I don't feel scared."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "899480"
msgid "I firmly believe that I'm going back to the\nright time and the right place.\nAt this point, I'm feeling the relief that follows victory."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "899616"
msgid "…although,\nI ended up erasing our time together.\nAnd you'll probably end up forgetting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "899708"
msgid "But, if you could just remember for a\nmoment longer…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "899764"
msgid "This is―――\nThis memory, as I recall―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "899812"
msgid "You've worked so hard.\nAmong all the Masters I've looked after,\nyou're the most remarkable one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "899908"
msgid "I wish you luck in your battles.\nAlso… if it's not too out of your way―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "899984"
msgid "Please treat the next me as well as\nyou've treated me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "900040"
msgid "#C080080080Light engulfs my consciousness before\nI can even reach my hand out into the void.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "900140"
msgid "#C080080080My fingers, arms, legs, body are disappearing into the light.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "900220"
msgid "#C080080080…only information now flows.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "900268"
msgid "#C080080080My consciousness violently accelerates.\nBackwards. Into a flashback.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "900356"
msgid "#C080080080In an instant, it's as if I had underwent a journey\nacross hundreds of light years. Suddenly―#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "900468"
msgid "I stated that the results were already in. This\nuniverse has no need for you if you can't accept\na truth after staring at it for 10 seconds."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "900612"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF disappears.\nDefeated despite wielding power rivaling #C236196003BB#CDEF's."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "900708"
msgid "…it seems you're still determined.\n………I have an idea. I value how you're\nsuch a glutton for punishment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "900816"
msgid "I stated that I would erase all traces of you\nfrom this universe, but I recant that statement.\nThat's a lie. There's a use for you yet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "900952"
msgid "First, I'll use parts of you as resources."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "900996"
msgid "I'll use part A to pave the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "901036"
msgid "I'll use part B to make Commissary items."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "901080"
msgid "I'll use part C to make a classroom chair."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "901124"
msgid "Just now, something―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "901152"
msgid "I'll use part D to make advanced materials\nfor hostile programs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "901220"
msgid "I've assessed that your thought-routine\nwill serve best for menial tasks."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "901296"
msgid "I'll keep your reason, humanity,\nand experiences intact…… and have you toil\naway as an OS."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "901392"
msgid "In your new role, you will serve as\nan entity of genetic amalgamation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "901464"
msgid "An organic factory. Every second, the amalgam\nwill transform, multiply you―so you can more\nefficiently serve as the carnivores' protein."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "901604"
msgid "You'll multiply, get eaten, get amalgamated,\nget hurt, suffer, transform,\ndie, get killed, then be reborn again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "901720"
msgid "I will grant you an eternal body.\nOne physically incapable of moving\na single inch."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "901804"
msgid "And of course―――your perspective will remain\nhuman. That will be suitable compensation\nfor all you've done."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "901916"
msgid "My consciousness gets severed from my #RUBSoriginal#RUBEhuman#REND body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "901992"
msgid "I came to find out just how repulsive, vile,\nand fiendish #C236196003BB#CDEF―――the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF's proposal was―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "902128"
msgid "I came to know a hell indescribable through any human language."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "902192"
msgid "At  present    no guest arrivals expected.\nIn the past    no guests have made visits.\nIn futurity    no guests will be required."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "902324"
msgid "Warning to visitor    002:\nPlease    delete your humanity immediately."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "902396"
msgid "You will be forcibly eliminated if you do not\nheed this    warning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "902464"
msgid "Your digital form will be disassembled into\nvarious software; your developed self-awareness\ntransferred to an NPC."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "902580"
msgid "A dry voice echoes throughout this boundless space."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "902632"
msgid "This is the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF;\nsilent as a still night and garnished with twirling\ncherry blossom petals;\n#C236196003BB#CDEF's world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "902784"
msgid "This is crazy talk… Disassembling you just for\ncoming here? \"Oh, by the way, it's not free so\nyou need to pay in body parts.\" …seriously?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "902924"
msgid "Her financial policies are progressive,\naren't they? The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF prefers\nbalancing resources over ethics."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "903048"
msgid "As much as I'd like to say that machines are\ninnocent things, the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF is super\ntechnology. The standards are different."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "903192"
msgid "My mentor gave me orders to destroy anything\nthat seemed to be out of control.\nI believe it applies here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "903300"
msgid "Yep. That fussy aspect of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF\nis proving scary right now.\nI say we forget #C236196003BB#CDEF and just smash this thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "903448"
msgid "Oops, sorry, can you hear us?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "903480"
msgid "So as you can see, all we can pick up from your\nsurroundings is sound. We have limited support\nto offer, but it's solid support!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "903612"
msgid "Sounds like the they can't survey the Core\nfrom the Student Council Room. I'm grateful that they're\nstill analyzing the situation in spite of that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "903760"
msgid "…hrm. Something smells off.\nThis space has contrasting elements."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "903828"
msgid "I'm not sure how to put it…\nDespite the deathly hush here,\nsomething about it captivates me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "903924"
msgid "I sense #C236196003BB#CDEF's girlish will.\nHowever, this entire area is seeped in womanly\nemotions. I don't like it one bit."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "904052"
msgid "…so that's what this is.\nThis side of the Moon had always been a store of\nhumanity's malignant information."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "904164"
msgid "Coming into contact with this raw grudge―it's\nno wonder #C236196003BB#CDEF changed. Still… something about\nall this isn't sitting right with me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "904312"
msgid "This space holds a compaction of resentment,\njealousy, envy, and grief. …like a box of\nnothing but negative sensibilities."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "904436"
msgid "Darling, be careful. It appears that the\nmastermind behind this entire affair is of the\nmost vile and wicked kind in all the world."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "904568"
msgid "―――Wow. I took this area to be suffused\nwith robotic negativity―but I see now something\nbizarre is in the mix."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "904684"
msgid "The #C000246204Far Side#CDEF is a box where human malignancy is\nconfined. If she, bathed in that malignancy,\nrules this place―then this is an underworld."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "904840"
msgid "However, there's a single, repulsive entity\nlurking here that can't conceal itself in this\ndarkness, try as it may."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "904956"
msgid "Don't get careless, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. #C236196003BB#CDEF is the one\nyou need to be saving. The one you need to\ndefeat seems to be some other Demon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "905112"
msgid "…I don't often see #C236196003#SVT#CDEF\nexpress this level of aversion to anything."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "905200"
msgid "…I get the feeling that #SVT[she][he][she][he]#'s being vigilant\nagainst a yet unknown actor, rather than #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "905328"
msgid "A cube floats under a blanket of black sky.\nSo that's the center of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "905428"
msgid "It's a calculating device within the Moon,\nleft behind by an alien civilization.\nIt gives form to the #C000246204SE.RA.PH#CDEF, a cyberspace.\nIt's a cage of light that perpetually stores\nendless numbers of #ROFS0002#RUBS records#RUBEfutures#REND―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "905680"
msgid "That's far enough.\nYou two have ignored all warnings.\nYou are not visitors."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "905756"
msgid "Proceed any further and you will considered\ntrespassers #RUBS     violating the rules#RUBEdisturbing the order#REND.\nYour souls will be erased."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "905900"
msgid "It's #C236196003BB#CDEF!\nRegardless of how you feel, Praetor,\nknow that she seems intent to kill!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "906000"
msgid "Get back, Master. Whatever her true motives may\nbe, her intent to kill is real. One step closer\nand you'll be a goner."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "906120"
msgid "So she thirsts for blood, after all that's\noccurred? #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, she seems to desire\na massacre between us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "906244"
msgid "―――I'm shocked, #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF.\nYour Servant acts more human than you do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "906340"
msgid "You're being slated for elimination here.\nWhy are you so dumbfounded? Or are you going\nto beg me for mercy at the last second?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "906468"
msgid "It's impossible to ask of me, unfortunately.\nI merged with the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF. Anyone who enters\nthis domain will be eliminated. Anyone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "906616"
msgid "So―――\nIf you value your life, you'll leave now.\nThis is your final warning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "906696"
msgid "The light in her eyes is gone, but she's still #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nHer merge with the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF isn't complete."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "906824"
msgid "I know because―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "906848"
msgid "Is that REALLY our final warning?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "906884"
msgid "Will you let us live if we leave?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "906920"
msgid "Yes, of course.\nThere will be no second chances. This is it.\nPlease quietly return to the school building."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "907028"
msgid "I thought I had stated that from the very\nbeginning. So long as you stay in the school\nbuilding, I will guarantee your safety."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "907156"
msgid "―――I've settled the matter."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "907188"
msgid "Clear communication really is always\nthe best policy."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "907244"
msgid "Mhm. That's a Praetor-brand declaration right\nthere. In case you were wondering,\nI also find #C236196003BB#CDEF to be fairly charming!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "907380"
msgid "Nice, well said.\nYou sure know how to pull through."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "907432"
msgid "But that makes her one of those demonic beasts\nI've heard of: a \"local wife.\" …I feel\ncuckolded. Something dark rouses within me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "907564"
msgid "Hahaha! Now THAT'S blunt, mongrel!\nYet excellent nonetheless! If that were a\nproposal of marriage, even I would accept it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "907688"
msgid "Y-you misunderstand―Senpai is playing foul!\nThat was uncalled for! A-anyone would be\ntaken aback after hearing that!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "907808"
msgid "W-wipe that smug look off your face!\nPlease don't get cocky with me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "907880"
msgid "Go on, finish your sentence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "907912"
msgid "I WILL release the hounds."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "907940"
msgid "Lie and I'll have your tongue."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "907972"
msgid "Ugh… like, I like…\nI don't… not like #[him][her]#."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "908028"
msgid "Phew.\nAnd with that, there's no more need for us to fight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "908088"
msgid "Or rather, I WANT us to talk this through."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "908132"
msgid "Taking hints from my hazy memories of our time in the Infirmary,\nI give her a good Senpai yelling at."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "908236"
msgid "I-I didn't mean that!\nThat was purely out of habit!\nI've never taken orders from you, Senpai!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "908332"
msgid "I stare sternly and silently at #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "908384"
msgid "…curiously, I feel happy and warm inside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "908428"
msgid "I see. Our relationship is undoubtedly\nthat of a Senpai and a Kouhai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "908500"
msgid "Mhm. A fine, sisterly relationship.\nFriends are hard to come by. Cherish them.\nI feel happy, too. I may even want in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "908620"
msgid "\"The child is father of the man,\" as they say.\nLooks like you made for a fine Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "908708"
msgid "Awww, I wish we were Senpai and Kouhai.\nI know, Darling. I'm your legal wife,\nso that won't be happening."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "908816"
msgid "I don't know about friendship or love here,\nbut there's certainly amity abound.\nQuite the \"Senpai,\" aren't you, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "908956"
msgid "W-wipe that smug look off your face!\nPlease don't get cocky with me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "909028"
msgid "Go on, finish your sentence."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "909060"
msgid "I WILL release the hounds."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "909088"
msgid "Lie and I'll have your tongue."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "909120"
msgid "Ugh… like, I like…\nI don't… not like #[him][her]#."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "909176"
msgid "Phew.\nAnd with that, there's no more need for us to fight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "909236"
msgid "Or rather, I WANT us to talk this through."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "909280"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF's radiating bloodlust and cold demeanor are genuine.\nShe's ready to promptly delete us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "909388"
msgid "…yet, she's not actually doing it.\nAll she has to do is erase the rebel elements before her.\nBut #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF made it all this way,\nand she respects #[his][her]# free will."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "909580"
msgid "…you still won't leave? This really really\nis your final warning. Please go back the\nway you came."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "909680"
msgid "That will settle the matter. Back in the school\nbuilding, you all can continue to bustle\nabout in this unending nightmare."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "909804"
msgid "There you have it.\nA second final warning―doesn't get any more\nmerciful than that. What will you do, Master?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "909916"
msgid "Agh, enough! I can't listen to ANY MORE of this!\nDarling, PLEASE put her in her place!\nThis is INFURIATING for #C236196003Tamamo#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "910052"
msgid "I see, so this is the truth. This was the case\nwith one of #C236196003Rin Tohsaka#CDEF's #C000246204SGs#CDEF. Not something\nI can listen to with a straight face."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "910216"
msgid "She fawns over you while wanting to spill\nyour blood. It's cringeworthy.\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, put the final nail in her coffin."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "910348"
msgid "Nothing is going to fix this predicament."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "910392"
msgid "All #C236196003BB#CDEF probably has to do is swing an arm\ndown to exercise the power of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF\nand drown us in darkness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "910536"
msgid "Nevertheless―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "910556"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF can hold a knife to my throat for all I care. \nI don't feel like fighting anymore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "910660"
msgid "I'll keep talking to #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "910704"
msgid "…wait, that's not how to word it.\nRather, I WANT to talk more with #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "910792"
msgid "A-ahem. My patience won't last much longer.\nThis really really REALLY is your final warning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "910888"
msgid "In retrospect, this word is a pretty indirect\nway to express one's feelings."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "910968"
msgid "…but in the process, she paved her way in atrocities."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "911024"
msgid "She has to be punished.\nStill, her punishment is one thing,\nbut my feelings towards her are another."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "911128"
msgid "It doesn't matter how many mistakes she makes.\nThere's definitely one thing that I'm grateful to her for."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "911236"
msgid "……that's right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "911256"
msgid "Maybe I end up dying in the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF,\nor I lose my life from some other cause.\nI don't know."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "911372"
msgid "But, #C236196003BB#CDEF DID find out.\nKnowing that #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF's future was short,\nshe protected #[him][her]# by creating this\nImaginary Number Space―a world where one can live\nbeyond their short future."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "911596"
msgid "Even if the means to do so wasn't justified;\neven if the person she sought to protect ended\nup hating her―she made it happen."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "911724"
msgid "So, if my words can still reach her―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "911768"
msgid "I'm cutting you off from the Moon Cell."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "911808"
msgid "Don't force yourself to do this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "911844"
msgid "The reason I did all this was so I could\ngain control of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "911932"
msgid "So why would you ask me to just give it up!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "911980"
msgid "There's an easy answer.\nMy reason is―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "912024"
msgid "You're important to me."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "912048"
msgid "Because I'm your Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "912076"
msgid "I'm… not forcing myself.\nIt's of my own volition. I did all this\nbecause there's something I wanted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "912180"
msgid "At this point… I can't go back.\nI know you know that, Senpai.\nSo why are you still saying such things!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "912288"
msgid "There's an easy answer.\nMy reason is―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "912332"
msgid "You're important to me."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "912356"
msgid "Because I'm your Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "912384"
msgid "We still haven't found a solution to this predicament,\nbut at least we can finally talk it over."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "912484"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF needs to return to normal condition.\nWe need to return to the Near Side of the Moon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "912600"
msgid "Well, the thing is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "912628"
msgid "It's because we're the same.\nTo Senpai, you and I are the same…\nTo be fair, you're the real one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "912728"
msgid "Isn't that right, #C236196003BB#CDEF?\nYou lost sight of your goal.\nOr rather―――it finally came to fruition."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "912840"
msgid "You said that you would save Senpai. You would\nkeep #[him][her]# safe from #[his][her]# fate. But in reality,\nyou wanted something else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "912980"
msgid "All you wanted was to spend time with Senpai,\nright? Just like old times back in the\nInfirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "913076"
msgid "You think… you can talk to me like that?\nYou foisted everything on ME so you\ncould revert back into a normal AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "913192"
msgid "I dare say it BECAUSE it's from me.\nI deleted those records.\nI pushed all those emotions onto you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "913292"
msgid "Look at #[him][her]#, #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nSenpai said #[he][she]# would protect me,\nan AI fated to simply disappear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "913412"
msgid "But #[his][her]# promise actually belongs to you.\nYou acquired \"love.\"\nOnly you can answer Senpai's feelings."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "913524"
msgid "Yes. So see for yourself.\nThis person gave us hearts.\nAsk #[him][her]# how #[he][she]# feels towards you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "913632"
msgid "Is it true…?\nIs it really true?\nAre you fine with a person like me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "913704"
msgid "I'm possessive and selfish,\ncaring and affectionate,\nwily and lewd and cowardly…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "913788"
msgid "This lady likes making her appeals\nnonchalant and brazen."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "913848"
msgid "The messes I'll make will be a massive pain!\nWe'll practically be fused at the hip! I'll do\nall this knowingly, despite loving you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "913980"
msgid "Well!?\nSee what you're getting yourself into!? Can you\nstill say that I'm \"important to you\"!?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "914076"
msgid "Yeah, I don't know about that…"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "914108"
msgid "That's fine with me."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "914132"
msgid "That's how I want it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "914156"
msgid "――Still, thank you.\nHere at the very, very end, you showed me\nthe cruelest dream I've ever seen――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "914260"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF closes her eyes.\nHowever, that simple act prompts our surroundings\nto become enveloped in darkness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "914380"
msgid "Ahh. In this moment, I understood:\nshe fell into despair just now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "914448"
msgid "I reply:\n\"That's right.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "914476"
msgid "After everything that's happened,\nI know more about #C236196003BB#CDEF's personality than I even asked for."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "914584"
msgid "And knowing full well, I said that #C236196003BB#CDEF is important to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "914660"
msgid "I don't want #C236196003BB#CDEF to break down.\nSo regardless of humanity's destruction or future,\nI want her away from the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "914812"
msgid "We still haven't found a solution to this predicament,\nbut at least we can finally talk it over."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "914912"
msgid "The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF needs to return to normal.\nWe need to return to the Near Side of the Moon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "915020"
msgid "How can you say that you'll forgive me\nafter everything I did!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "915084"
msgid "Well, the thing is―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "915112"
msgid "It's because we're the same.\nTo Senpai, you and I are the same…\nTo be fair, you're the real one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "915212"
msgid "Isn't that right, #C236196003BB#CDEF?\nYou lost sight of your goal.\nOr rather―――it finally came to fruition."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "915324"
msgid "You said that you would save Senpai. You would\nkeep #[him][her]# safe from #[his][her]# fate. But in reality,\nyou wanted something else."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "915464"
msgid "All you wanted was to spend time with Senpai,\nright? Just like old times back in the\nInfirmary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "915560"
msgid "You think… you can talk to me like that?\nYou foisted everything on ME so you\ncould revert back into a normal AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "915676"
msgid "I dare say it BECAUSE it's from me.\nI deleted those records.\nI pushed all those emotions onto you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "915776"
msgid "Senpai… #[he][she]#, considers #C236196003Sakura#CDEF to be #[his][her]# Kouhai.\nAnd that's not me, it's you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "915888"
msgid "Look at #[him][her]#, #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nSenpai said #[he][she]# would protect #C236196003Sakura#CDEF,\nan AI fated to simply disappear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "916028"
msgid "…see for yourself.\nThis person gave us hearts.\nAsk #[him][her]# how #[he][she]# truly feels."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "916124"
msgid "Is it true…?\nIs it really true?\nWill you forgive me?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "916180"
msgid "I treated you like a toy, Senpai.\n…yeah, if I'm being honest here, I wanted\nto be a pain in your neck."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "916284"
msgid "You shared your smile with me, Senpai.\nI wanted more of your attention. I wanted you\nto be my Senpai and my Senpai only!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "916408"
msgid "Those days were as fun as could be…\nI made a mess of many things so that I\ncould talk more with you, Senpai."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "916520"
msgid "I can't have a mean-spirited Kouhai…"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "916560"
msgid "You bet I'll yell at you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "916588"
msgid "…you're right.\nI don't qualify as any sort of \"Kouhai\" anymore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "916656"
msgid "All I ever do is feed my own ego.\n――Thank you. You showed me the cruelest\ndream I've ever seen――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "916760"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF closes her eyes.\nHowever, that simple act prompts our surroundings\nto become enveloped in darkness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "916880"
msgid "Ahh. In this moment, I understood:\nshe fell into despair just now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "916948"
msgid "\"You bet I'll yell at you,\" I answer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "916988"
msgid "Everyone's got a bad side.\nTo be a friend means accepting that―sometimes being\nencouraging about it, and sometimes calling one out on it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "917128"
msgid "I approve of this pain-in-the-ass Kouhai of mine.\nI respect her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "917196"
msgid "I don't want #C236196003BB#CDEF to break down.\nSo regardless of humanity's destruction\nor future, I want her away from the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "917348"
msgid "But… but how am I supposed to do that?\nIf the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF returns to normal, you'll――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "917452"
msgid "You have it all wrong, #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "917496"
msgid "This isn't the way #[he][she]# wants to be saved.\n#[He][She]#'s the type of person to accept anyone.\nWe fell in love with #[him][her]#."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "917632"
msgid "This isn't the way #[he][she]# wants to be saved.\n#[He][She]#'s the type of person to accept anyone.\nWe admired #[him][her]#."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "917760"
msgid "The goal of saving Senpai from doom was nothing\nbut a dream of yours; my dream. Still―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "917852"
msgid "…so please don't restrain #[his][her]# feelings,\nfor you've come to know what real love is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "917948"
msgid "…I hate to admit it, but you're right. My\nselfish desire brought about all this. This\nwhole time, I've been fussing over nothing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "918080"
msgid "Fine. I'll let go of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF then.\nCut my connection to the Core. The self-repair\nfunction should take care of the rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "918224"
msgid "I still don't really get why she said she\n\"would protect #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF\"\nor what she was trying to protect herself against―\nBut now the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF will return to normal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "918428"
msgid "Now it's settled―humanity won't be dying from euphoria…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "918488"
msgid "W-what's got you jumping for joy? I just got \ntired of dealing with this mess, is all. Don't\nthink that I'll reform into a good girl now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "918628"
msgid "Protecting you alone would've sufficed for me,\nanyway. I never had any interest in doing\nanything to humanity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "918740"
msgid "And with that, it's all over.\nNow we'll head back to the Student Council Room and―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "918828"
msgid "\"It's over,\" my ass! #C000246204Seven Days Later#CDEF rebooted!\nAnd now it says that the mortality\nrate is 100 percent!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "918948"
msgid "What's going on!?\nHumanity is going to get pulverized here, man!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "919016"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, #C236196003BB#CDEF, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF!\nWe need confirmation! We haven't detected\nany changes in the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF yet!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "919180"
msgid "Wha―――what's the deal!?\nCan we not cancel the Earth-intervention!?\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "919276"
msgid "I'm trying, but…! I can't do it!\nThis #RUBS   program#RUBEtechnique#REND has been corrupting\nmy own Core from the very start!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "919404"
msgid "New user entry changed from AI to Master.\n#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF is now\nregistered as the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "919532"
msgid "There it is. The exquisite taste\nof the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF you were so desperate\nto get your hands on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "919644"
msgid "#C236196003Sessyoin#CDEF…!\nNow I see, so it was YOUR presence that\nwas out of place here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "919736"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF!?\nThe hell is this!? How can a single Master\ntake over the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "919856"
msgid "―――I figured you might show up.\nI'm not completely surprised, #C236196003Sessyoin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "919948"
msgid "It's #C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "919988"
msgid "You expected this lady to be dead?\nAbsolute imbecile. What, did you think she was\na saint this entire time!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "920100"
msgid "Look at the sheer audacity and debauchery\nof how she acts! You think a stab in the back,\na bisection would kill this kind of spirit!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "920236"
msgid "Here's the rundown: she expertly survived,\noutwitted you all, and even took over the\n#C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF! My Master here is bile-inducing!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "920384"
msgid "Impossible! I had even checked that your vital\nsigns had vanished…! It's a fact that\none entity had been deleted then!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "920504"
msgid "That was #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF. This lady here only stole\nthat #C000246204Ego#CDEF's abilities after absorbing her.\nThe body was used as a stand-in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "920660"
msgid "N-no, a human isn't capable of such a thing,\nlet alone seizing the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF!\nYou're not even a #C236196003Sakura#CDEF model…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "920804"
msgid "I'm just a normal Master.\nI don't have access rights to the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF\nlike you and the others have, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "920944"
msgid "For example―――Tampering with an AI\nby inflicting on it some unforeseen malady."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "921028"
msgid "Hey, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF?\nWhat diagnosis did you make of the abnormality\nyou two had, I wonder."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "921128"
msgid "Was the overheating from overwork?\nBut we know that's no explanation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "921200"
msgid "Yes. I was the one who made you crash in the\npreliminaries. I'm also the one who initiated\nyour backup, #C236196003BB#CDEF. Also―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "921336"
msgid "I planted an idea neither of you could've\nconceived into #C236196003BB#CDEF's mind: the grand ambition\nof \"unleashing humanity's desires.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "921476"
msgid "I had you and #C236196003BB#CDEF―no, every being trapped\nhere within the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF\ndancing in the palm of my hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "921620"
msgid "―――Her confession deafens my mind blank."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "921664"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara#CDEF was behind all of this?\nIncluding the end of human civilization\nthat the #C000246204Seven Days Later#CDEF showed us?\nShe instigated everything that happened\nhere in the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "921896"
msgid "Yes, that's the motive you two had. I merely\nfound an AI with access rights to the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF\nand destroyed their self-awareness inhibitor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "922052"
msgid "I used the #RUBS  Ten-thousand Colored Stagnation#RUBE#C000246204Multi-Colored Tranquility#CDEF#REND\nto enter you and launch your self-awareness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "922200"
msgid "After that, I had planned to coax you once\nyou became human―――\nBut then I changed my mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "922296"
msgid "Heehee. I found out about the Infirmary.\nTwo youths, locked away for months together…\nWho wouldn't want to support you two?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "922424"
msgid "Then, you had… from the very beginning…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "922468"
msgid "―――I don't get it.\nI can't reason a shred of logic behind\nwhat this woman is thinking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "922560"
msgid "But it's clear what we need to do now.\nWe need to save #C236196003Sakura#CDEF and take down #C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "922684"
msgid "I'll see to it that she's silenced―――\nWha… my body… won't move!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "922756"
msgid "Agreed. Time to put her to the sword…\nWha―I can't move―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "922820"
msgid "I wish I could tell you that I'll see that it\ngets done… but I apologize.\nI can't seem to move a muscle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "922928"
msgid "―――You'll have to forgive me. I blundered.\nI WAS wary of the mastermind's appearance, but\nyour exchange with #C236196003BB#CDEF proved too humorous."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "923080"
msgid "I accidentally took my eyes off of my footing.\nI can't stir my body in the slightest.\nShe got me, yes. She got me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "923196"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF steps forward to protect #C236196003Sakura#CDEF,\nthen freezes up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "923284"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF may have done something to rob\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF of #SVT[her][his][her][his]# self-control."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "923412"
msgid "―――And of course, the same applies to me.\nI had dashed off towards #C236196003Sakura#CDEF,\nbut now my legs are practically stone…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "923548"
msgid "How egotistical can this king get…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "923588"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF may have done something to rob\n#C236196003#SVT#CDEF of #SVT[her][his][her][his]# self-control."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "923716"
msgid "―――And of course, the same applies to me.\nI had dashed off towards #C236196003Sakura#CDEF,\nbut now my legs are practically stone…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "923852"
msgid "I'm so sorry.\nYou were all such easy pickings, chatting away \nwith #C236196003BB#CDEF. I just had to…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "923956"
msgid "Gah! How dare you bind an emperor…!\nYour schemes will cost you dearly, #C236196003Sessyoin#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "924056"
msgid "Spiritron thread―this must be a\nTachikawa school art!\nThis woman is full of tricks…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "924144"
msgid "The five skhandas… a black thread for subduing\none's vanity! How can a nun so depraved\nwield such a virtuous art so well!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "924268"
msgid "These shackle are for restraining one's vanity.\nIt's no wonder I can't move―――\nThis woman is intelligent. Aggravatingly so."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "924396"
msgid "Heehee. Please forgive me. I need to take care\nof this one here first. After, the rest of us\nwill take our sweet time together―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "924532"
msgid "Don't count your chickens before they hatch,\n#C236196003Kiara#CDEF. Hurry up and finish the job.\nThen I'll be able to pack my bags."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "924664"
msgid "Goodness, you're no fun… Still, a valid point.\nThe Student Council girls yet live. I can't have\nthem pulling the rug from under me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "924800"
msgid "Not being able to drag #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF\nhere was my one failure.\nThose two are incredible. Too incredible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "924936"
msgid "I can't even move my mouth to yell at #C236196003Sakura#CDEF to run.\nIt looks like she can move,\nbut #C236196003Kiara#CDEF's intimidation locks her in place."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "925096"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF, our last hope, can't move either.\nWe also stopped getting signals from the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "925216"
msgid "―――Why? What are you after!?\nWhat do you possibly need\ncontrol of the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF for!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "925324"
msgid "Tough to say.\nIf I had to, perhaps I could say that\nI'm doing this out of love."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "925404"
msgid "It seems that I did this for the sake of my\nlove; out of a want to have every single\nperson there melted down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "925516"
msgid "―――.\nI don't understand.\nYou're contradicting yourself…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "925580"
msgid "I can tell that you're not lying. But… if this\nis out of love―if you DO love people,\nthen you wouldn't do something so horrible!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "925712"
msgid "Love between men and women; love between\nlovers―these are both nefarious things.\nWhat society calls \"love\" is evil."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "925832"
msgid "What is the emotion of love? A heart that seeks.\nOne who pursues only their own desires\nout of greed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "925936"
msgid "The only correct love is that which is uncondit-\nional towards the weak: Buddhism defines \"love\"\nas a mother's instincts towards her child."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "926076"
msgid "The \"love\" women and girls deliver is\nmerely a wicked desire to consume others.\nSame with #C236196003BB#CDEF's love, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "926200"
msgid "And I, too, am but one woman.\nMy love is the same as #C236196003BB#CDEF's."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "926276"
msgid "I captured the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF out of love,\nand I will destroy humanity for that love.\nThere's no contradiction."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "926400"
msgid "The \"love\" you speak is nothing more than\nselfishness! Please don't claim that your\nrotten ambitions can be called \"love\"!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "926524"
msgid "Oh, my. One whom cannot comprehend love such\nas yourself would say such?\nScience is rejecting love―――How poetic."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "926640"
msgid "It's fine, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nAn AI like yourself is allowed to reject love.\nOr rather, you have to reject love."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "926760"
msgid "Science is a discipline that isn't\ncaught up in emotion. It's all about normality.\nWhich is why―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "926864"
msgid "Enough drivel.\nNow―――Return to your simple machine self,\nmy adorable little nurse."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "926952"
msgid "She had more of a plain flavor to her than\n#C236196003BB#CDEF did. Yet―――She was the sweeter one.\nPerfect for a dessert."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "927076"
msgid "…I can't move my limbs."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "927104"
msgid "I had just finished telling #C236196003Sakura#CDEF and #C236196003BB#CDEF that\nI would protect them both―――\nYet here I am letting the Mastermind have\nher way right before my eyes―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "927296"
msgid "Heehee. Wonderful. Your bloodlust is practically\nscalding. The one and only #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF wants\nit, and I would like to indulge, but…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "927440"
msgid "Give me a moment to dress up, first. I seem to\nhave received so many souls and desires that\nmy body is on the verge of bursting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "927572"
msgid "Ready, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF?\nI'll grant you your wish.\nPresent your Noble Phantasm to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "927668"
msgid "Ladies and gentleman gathered here today:\n#C236196003Andersen#CDEF shall now tell you all the story of\na woman."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "927780"
msgid "A woman overflowing with love, mad with love;\ndelighted to welcome any immorality and tainted\nby a breadth of desires."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "927900"
msgid "The woman's name: #C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF. The group\ngathered here to defeat #C236196003Kiara#CDEF―we know―is our\nhope, for we discern justly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "928052"
msgid "Good and evil may yet to be fully defined,\nbut today it is clear: #C236196003Sessyoin#CDEF is evil.\nThese lovestruck youths are good."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "928188"
msgid "That's―――his Noble Phantasm.\n#C236196003Andersen#CDEF used his own Noble Phantasm on #C236196003Kiara#CDEF,\nhis own Master…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "928320"
msgid "YES, EXQUISITE…! I'm dying in the span of a\nsingle second―――The three thousand realms of\nexistence, collapsing in the blink of an eye!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "928460"
msgid "A gale rages.\nNo, a vacuum is forming."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "928500"
msgid "Everything within this space is flowing\ninto #C236196003Kiara#CDEF as she glows with light."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "928592"
msgid "Within the light―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "928612"
msgid "We won't be able to recover from what's about to happen.\nThose two need to be stopped right now…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "928712"
msgid "Absolutely disgusting.\nThis must mark the birth of one of\nthose heaven-demons."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "928792"
msgid "UGH, this SUCKS!\nWho would've thought my greatest work\nwould produce such a foul monster!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "928884"
msgid "Gah, I still can't move…\n#C236196003Andersen#CDEF!!\nGet your head out of your ass already!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "928976"
msgid "Isn't it a Servant's duty to stay our Masters\nfrom villainy!? If you don't like this, then\ncease at once! Whose damned side are you on!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "929116"
msgid "Gah…!\nThese threads are only getting tighter!\nWe'll get absorbed too, at this rate…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "929204"
msgid "#C236196003Andersen#CDEF! Was all that talk of justice nothing\nbut lies!? If you don't like this, then stop!\nWhose fucking side are you on!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "929348"
msgid "She even plans on using #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF functions!?\nI can't get this thread off, though…!\nWhere did she learn about all this bondage!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "929496"
msgid "Agh! Forget about shame or honor, they're\nall out the window now!\nGet a grip, you little brat!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "929592"
msgid "Grr, the thread only grow tighter!\nAre we going to get absorbed, as well…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "929672"
msgid "You blaspheme me, knave! Know that my contact\nwith such an infernal woman's soul shall be the\ngreatest sin humanity has ever witnessed!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "929808"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF! If you're going to speak of justice,\nthen stay your Master's hand!\nJust whose side are you on!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "929928"
msgid "Hmph. You want to know whose side I'm on?\nIsn't it obvious? A Servant takes the side\nof their Master."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "930032"
msgid "Don't ask me stupid questions.\nWe follow our Masters to perdition's underbelly\nif need be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "930124"
msgid "Don't ask me stupid questions.\nWe follow our Masters to perdition's underbelly\nif need be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "930216"
msgid "Don't ask me stupid questions.\nWe follow our Masters to perdition's underbelly\nif need be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "930308"
msgid "Don't ask me stupid questions.\nWe follow our Masters to perdition's underbelly\nif need be."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "930400"
msgid "Oh, my―――Now this is odd.\nYou've finally learned how to make\na compliment, #C236196003Andersen#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "930504"
msgid "Heehee, very wise.\nI AM about to become the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF. I take it\nyou're frightened of losing my favor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "930624"
msgid "Hmph. Though as you can see, my vulgar Master\nhere really sends the stomach reeling.\nBut what can I say―it's my job."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "930744"
msgid "Still, her transformation is taking surprisingly\nlong. Tells you something about how vast\nthe pool of corruption within her is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "930872"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF's bonds should be unraveling soon.\nBefore that happens, I'd like to kindly ask\nyou two to wait outside for a moment."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "931012"
msgid "You can give me as much flack as you'd like.\nIt's not like I could take\nthe both of you on by myself, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "931124"
msgid "A weight bears down on my entire body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "931164"
msgid "This is forced extraction―――\n#C236196003Andersen#CDEF intends to drive us outside!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "931252"
msgid "Heehee. Don't worry. You'll find yourself in\na brand new world, and I'll be there to share\nplenty of love with everyone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "931376"
msgid "Until then―――\nPlease enjoy the experience of sinking\ninto my memories."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "931452"
msgid "#C080080080My consciousness and my body are being flung\naway…!#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "931524"
msgid "#C080080080―――#C236196003Sakura#CDEF#C080080080―――!#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "931588"
msgid "Time is virtually halted in this area.\nOne second in the world outside equates\nto tens of thousands having passed here.\nThis is their brink."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "931732"
msgid "Still kicking, huh? You just don't know when\nto quit, #C236196003Kiara#CDEF. There's no saving you out of\nthis one. Hurry up and take death's hug."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "931880"
msgid "I was planning to, thank you very much…\nHowever, I can't bear to die―yet.\n#C236196003Andersen#CDEF, please answer something for me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "932016"
msgid "Hm? A question? There are things you DON'T know?\nBeing connected to the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF,\nyou should get answers to anything instantly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "932164"
msgid "That's not entirely true. The #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF is\nignorant when it comes to human emotions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "932268"
msgid "You said something before…\nThat I was \"defeated by two youths in love.\"\n…that's what I don't understand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "932376"
msgid "I know what \"love\" is.\nBut I never had the opportunity to learn\nwhat it means to be \"in love.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "932472"
msgid "Please tell me, if you know. What is it to\nbe \"in love\"? How is it any different\nfrom any other \"love\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "932576"
msgid "So that's what you don't know?\nShit, my sides might just explode with laughter!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "932656"
msgid "You have to be joking!\nThe most salacious woman in the world being\nthe most inexperienced in the world!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "932764"
msgid "…hm. Sorry, that was mean. This is no laughing\nmatter, that much is true. I'll apologize by\ngiving you your explanation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "932888"
msgid "\"Love\" comes from a seeking heart.\nBeing \"in love\" comes from a dreaming heart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "932968"
msgid "―――A dreaming―――heart?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "933000"
msgid "Reality breaks those \"in love\" who face it.\nReality distorts in the face of \"love.\" \"Love\"\nfalters in the face of those \"in love.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "933132"
msgid "That's what a proper relation between a man and\na woman looks like. I know you're on the verge\nand all, but remember it well. Think it over."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "933276"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara#CDEF's mouth twists into a bitter smile."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "933336"
msgid "It's as if she's saying, \"it's so obvious\"――\n\"Thinking about it now, it never occurred\nto me in my entire life.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "933452"
msgid "#C236196003Kiara#CDEF begins to deteriorate."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "933500"
msgid "The reality is that her destruction will only take a second.\nBut in this place, she has a few extra minutes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "933612"
msgid "Heehee. Now you'll be released, too.\nHas the solace hit you yet,\nMr. Misogynist Drivel-peddler?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "933708"
msgid "Where did the hell did you get that?\nSeriously, you failure of a woman.\nYou can't read men worth a damn."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "933816"
msgid "All I feel right now are pangs of regret.\nI wasn't able to leave you, the protagonist,\nwith a happy ending."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "933924"
msgid "Why regret? You've done nothing but disparage\nme at every turn.\n…you would call me ugly, toxic, and such."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "934032"
msgid "I did say such things.\nAnd they were all nothing but the truth.\nYou're the paragon of a woman's nature―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "934140"
msgid "I don't recall ever―not even once―saying that\nI \"hate\" you. I held my tongue down in\nirons so that I wouldn't!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "934256"
msgid "――――Aah.\nNow that you mention it, you're right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "934308"
msgid "I don't. I simply don't love people, is all.\nThis is why presumptuous readers are such\npains in my ass."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "934412"
msgid "…it's a pain when the author has\nfixations only they understand, too…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "934484"
msgid "Silence, titty-demon. I suppose I have to draw\nit out for you, though it'll take a while. I\ncan't go until I get this off my back, too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "934620"
msgid "#C236196003Andersen#CDEF's shoulders slump in disappointment\nas his vitriol rolls."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "934704"
msgid "…and that's how #C236196003Andersen#CDEF began,\nfinally at the very end, telling his own story."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "934804"
msgid "Ages ago, before I became somewhat of a writer\nand sent my life down the drain: by chance, I\nlearned of love from the life of a lone girl."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "934944"
msgid "She had been abandoned by her parents young\nand shunned by society. Yet, she bore no\nresentment towards anyone."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "935056"
msgid "Despite having never felt a shred of joy, she\ngave to many affection and guidance. She never\nonce spoke of the grief of her oppression."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "935192"
msgid "Observing people is my specialty. I watched her,\nspoke with her, gained her trust―― and after\nsix years, I finally heard how she truly felt."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "935336"
msgid "…so,\nthis is what the girl, scarred from\nhead to toe, said to me:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "935404"
msgid "There must be suffering in life.\nThere must be no hate towards life.\nThe reason is,"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "935488"
msgid "\"One day, happiness will come greet me.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "935532"
msgid "This girl had never known warmth, yet she\nbelieved in the warmth of people.\nA dreamer. Smiling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "935628"
msgid "…it was a cold night before spring."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "935668"
msgid "That was when I learned that this word,\n\"love,\" is no imaginary thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "935740"
msgid "I couldn't bring myself to get close to\nthe girl."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "935792"
msgid "I'm a good-for-nothing wretch, don't forget.\nI believed that the right man for that girl,\nthe right happiness for her was out there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "935928"
msgid "After several years had passed, the girl was\ntaken in to be the wife of a wealthy man. That\nwealthy man was an old friend of mine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "936060"
msgid "A respectable man. She would do well in his\nhands, I knew. With that, all was right with the\nworld. I celebrated with fine wine that day."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "936200"
msgid "―――The girl's brutalized corpse was found in\na ditch in the outskirts of town,\nnot seven days later on a spring morning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "936324"
msgid "Was the man I had considered a friend no more\nthan an animal? At this point, it doesn't\nmatter anymore."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "936428"
msgid "From that I learned a fact:\nthat we, everyone, is detestable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "936492"
msgid "Within human society,\nlove is useless and nonexistent."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "936548"
msgid "I swore to myself at that moment:\nI would never love people again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "936616"
msgid "…that's the conclusion he came to, in contrast with #C236196003Kiara#CDEF's."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "936696"
msgid "That's the reason why #C236196003Andersen#CDEF doesn't recognize \"love.\"\nHowever―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "936784"
msgid "However, you're no longer human.\nYou've fallen to the ranks of a different\nkind of monster."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "936876"
msgid "I don't see any issue, in that case.\nIf you're a god, then I could love you.\nMight be fun."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "936968"
msgid "The surprise comes after some usual vitriol."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "937016"
msgid "In spite of #C236196003Kiara#CDEF being deteriorated up to her waist.\nThe act is done with slight, nuanced grace."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "937132"
msgid "…and it's not just #C236196003Kiara#CDEF; I'm at a loss for words, too."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "937208"
msgid "It feels like I just witnessed an\nearth-shattering confession of love."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "937280"
msgid "…heehee. Like you, I'm a mess on the inside,\ntoo. Your personality is as complicated\nan enigma as mine, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "937396"
msgid "Of course.\nI wouldn't still be writing crap\nafter my own death, otherwise."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "937472"
msgid "His merciless tongue brings a wry smile to #C236196003Kiara Sessyoin#CDEF's\nface."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "937556"
msgid "Her gaze is gentle, like an innocent girl\nawaiting the arrival of spring."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "937632"
msgid "…my goodness.\nNo wonder I was defeated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "937676"
msgid "If this nasty man is my number one disciple,\nthen that explains why I'm such a sham."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "937764"
msgid "What is it? You going to stand there and peep\nwhen other people are having a moment?\nNot very classy, you two."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "937876"
msgid "Go on, shoo. No one is asking for your sympathy\nor thoughts. This isn't much of a grand finale―\nBut it's a plot I can get behind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "938008"
msgid "You all can hate #C236196003Kiara#CDEF if you want.\nShe really is wicked down to the core.\nNot worth saving."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "938120"
msgid "Still―――No matter who it is, anyone who puts\ntheir life on the line for their happiness,\nto me, is a precious light."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "938240"
msgid "Even if it's dim and not worth the bother;\nillusory. …one can see it, warm within\nthe last lamp."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "938340"
msgid "That's all there is to say about that.\nThis was #C236196003Kiara#CDEF's story, and a story\nI wanted to read."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "938452"
msgid "―――Hmph.\nAnd thus, I'm quitting writing. Leaving it all\nbehind. And man does it feel good!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "938548"
msgid "Farewell, boys and girls with troubles abound!\nGo―fall in love, get lost in love, live in\nsuffering! There's no time to waste!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "938676"
msgid "There's nothing left here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "938704"
msgid "Like #C236196003Andersen#CDEF said, there's no time to waste.\nI take off, racing towards my own story."
msgstr ""

